{"id": "RT-sources-method", "body": {"t": "main", "a": {"class": "wrap", "id": "main-content"}, "c": [" ", {"t": "p", "a": {"class": "kicker"}, "c": ["Source control · work in progress"]}, {"t": "h1", "c": ["How evidence is handled"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "a": {"class": "lede"}, "c": ["A document can show what was written. It cannot, by itself, show that a promised action happened. This site keeps those steps apart."]}, " ", {"t": "article", "a": {"class": "article-body"}, "c": [" ", {"t": "ol", "c": [" ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Keep the source:"]}, " record the issuer, title, version and date. Preserve an original when permission and privacy allow."]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["State one claim at a time:"]}, " attach the exact source and distinguish its words from a paraphrase."]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Mark the leap:"]}, " separate documented fact, first-person account, inference, hypothesis and requested remedy."]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Keep the counterpoint:"]}, " if a response disputes the claim, record it with its date and the specific issue it addresses."]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Check implementation:"]}, " a response, review, assurance or promise is not a completed treatment, published pathway or closed action."]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Correct visibly:"]}, " a corrected date, scope or attribution should identify what changed and why."]}, " "]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "c": ["Project working documents"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["The site's evidence method draws on a separate project draft. ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/docs/evidence-engineering-reference-v0-2.docx"}, "c": ["Evidence Engineering Standard Reference Specification v0.2 (DOCX)"]}, " and its ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/docs/evidence-engineering-review-v0-2.docx"}, "c": ["review resolution register (DOCX)"]}, " are included for readers who want to inspect the method. The title is a project name: it is not an ISO, BSI, statutory, regulatory or professionally endorsed standard. It does not certify this website or any case finding."]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "c": ["Privacy boundary"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["The public archive carries policy copies, permitted extracts, the project method and the first-person video already presented on the site. It does not carry the personal clinical correspondence, submissions or working contact lists. Removing a postal address and NHS number alone would not make a clinical record anonymous."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/evidence-map/"}, "c": ["See the public evidence map"]}, " · ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/"}, "c": ["Browse source documents"]}]}, " "]}, " ", " ", {"t": "aside", "a": {"class": "lib-block", "aria-labelledby": "lib-heading"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "a": {"id": "lib-heading"}, "c": ["From the library"]}, {"t": "p", "a": {"class": "lib-note"}, "c": ["Dated articles, sources, visuals and downloads for this section, held in the MJB ADHD library on Google Drive and added to over time. ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/archive/"}, "c": ["How the library works"]}]}, {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "lib-grid"}, "c": [{"t": "div", "a": {"class": "lib-repo", "id": "lib-research"}, "c": [{"t": "h3", "c": ["Research"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Papers and reading notes, with their limits stated."]}, {"t": "ul", "a": {"class": "lib-links"}, "c": [{"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YvbElGz6W_Lq-L-TbELcfjejSuvk4wu3", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["Articles", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "visually-hidden"}, "c": [" for Research (opens Google Drive)"]}]}]}, {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tG3w6Fa0mIbPmONna9oSt_4pXvuiyF5C", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["Sources", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "visually-hidden"}, "c": [" for Research (opens Google Drive)"]}]}]}, {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "